    "29817d12-4af7-49ab-8a92-c41c03e71d08": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14907164164170__29817d12-4af7-49ab-8a92-c41c03e71d08-item-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What equipment do I need for these workouts?",
            "content": "<p>This program is designed to be done in a gym setting, so access to basic gym equipment is necessary. You’ll be using machines like the leg press, cable machine, and hip thrust bench, along with free weights such as dumbbells and barbells. These tools allow for proper resistance and progression, which are key to building glute strength effectively.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_9pxiP4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How soon can I expect to see results?",
            "content": "<p>Many participants notice changes in the first 2–3 weeks—like improved glute activation, better posture, and more energy. Visible results typically appear around weeks 4–6 with consistent effort and proper recovery.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_yTgMeY": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can beginners do these programs?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! This course was designed specifically with beginners in mind. You'll start with foundational moves and gradually build strength, form, and confidence each week. No prior experience is needed.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14907164164170__29817d12-4af7-49ab-8a92-c41c03e71d08-item-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I complete the workouts at my own pace?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! While the program is structured over 8 weeks, you can move through it at a pace that works best for your schedule and fitness level. You’re in full control—no pressure, just progress.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_GV48Lj": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I access the programs and materials offline?",
            "content": "<p>The materials are available online only in your nasswear.com profile</p>"
          }
        }
      },
